<description>&lt;p&gt;Recent developments include the sentencing of a man extradited from Mexico to 20 years for a fatal Longview shooting, and the arrest of a Mexican judge accused of taking a $2 million bribe to free a drug trafficker linked to former Olympian Ryan Wedding. Vehicle pursuits from Riverside County have ended in officer-involved shootings near the U.S.-Mexico border, and a federal officer in Houston shot a man who was not an ICE target. A serial rapist extradited from Mexico was convicted for murders in 2002, and intelligence agencies reported an alleged Mexican-Dawood cartel nexus targeting India. 37 battle-related deaths were recorded in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KETK.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOTEhnMmdXWmh4YVlNeEd6dnMzcXRZR3RPMzRxdkdrWEJVUDJsTmMwcFVGZFNicjlTeXQxNEtPdUUzYnU4a2k2YjBOS25QOWZvUndxZ3dFMWttbVNfdlQzTllEUmt3VVBGMFpadmpKdkhrUzg5OWstV09ocGNSX3FLbEdpNEItM3FTRzZGZW1OdW5SR3h2Xy1Ndg?oc=5&quot;&gt;CBS News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KYMA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNSmNOS3J5NHhweVp5Z1ZrVmFEdml4ZnNsd3JWM2RTN19iWUstd3l2eUZxSkt0NndtTXI5V2VkTEZOYTM3ZlpZbVJ4SnFRMWdoTFFxYWh1ekF4Nko2ZkdtUklIV3UzTDNHcFViODhxU2RJSGNNWmxnMlo0c1dFTnhSeQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;FOX 11 Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC7 Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NBC 7 San Diego&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxQTjhvQUNDemFWcm1qaXo5eU5rbGpRX3Viak5abnp1X3lsWEVmM3I3WFVXdXExOVE5NDN4VjdCcGdqMjRDSEd0WV9rYnZjS1VZMWlxU0p2Y0lhX2RHU